1
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:09,000
We did our best

2
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,500
Most of the toxins have been cleared from the stomach

3
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,333
But the patient is elderly

4
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:21,800
He's in poor health

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,000
As for when he'll wake up

6
00:00:24,366 --> 00:00:25,266
It's hard to say

7
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:33,600
Future medical costs will be high

8
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:36,366
Does the patient have any other children

9
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:39,300
Where is Daniel

10
00:00:43,433 --> 00:00:44,433
I don't know

11
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,200
Since the accident

12
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,433
He hasn't shown up once

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,433
Is he even human

14
00:00:51,633 --> 00:00:53,566
His parents even risked their lives for him

15
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,333
Yet he won't even show his face at the hospital

16
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,166
We shouldn't have given him that money

17
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:03,400
I've already had the bank recover that two million

18
00:01:04,633 --> 00:01:06,933
Doctor, regardless of the cost

19
00:01:07,133 --> 00:01:07,966
We want they treated

20
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:17,433
Sir, your card has an insufficient balance

21
00:01:17,466 --> 00:01:18,366
You can't buy a ticket

22
00:01:19,933 --> 00:01:21,933
Impossible, there should be two million in there

23
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,200
Hey, what happened to the money in my account

24
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,100
Where is my two million

25
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,233
Did you transfer it away

26
00:01:36,266 --> 00:01:38,666
Sir, as this money is in dispute

27
00:01:38,666 --> 00:01:40,700
The sender has requested a reversal

28
00:01:41,333 --> 00:01:44,466
Lewes, you dare play me

29
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,133
Daniel

30
00:01:58,433 --> 00:01:59,833
Where do you think you're going

31
00:02:00,866 --> 00:02:01,433
Trying to run

32
00:02:01,966 --> 00:02:04,666
Brian, I wasn't running

33
00:02:04,866 --> 00:02:06,733
I just stepped out for a bit

34
00:02:14,933 --> 00:02:15,533
Damn it

35
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:16,466
After him

36
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,766
Damn, get everyone out there

37
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:31,166
Scour every inch of Verdant Town

38
00:02:31,333 --> 00:02:32,700
Find him and drag him back to me
